				{
					"id": 727180101,
					"content": "關於提瓦特煎蛋…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						727180102
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 727180102,
					"content": "#哦哦，{F#妳}{M#你}是看到了我的委託才來的吧。不管是烏有亭還是木南料亭，都太無趣了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						727180103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "松本"
				},
				{
					"id": 727180103,
					"content": "說不定在意想不到的地方，反而存在著廚藝超凡的高人，所以我才發了那則委託。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						727180104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "松本"
				},
				{
					"id": 727180104,
					"content": "#好了，{F#妳}{M#你}既然過來了，那五份提瓦特煎蛋也一定準備好了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						727180107,
						727180105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "松本"
				},
				{
					"id": 727180107,
					"content": "準備好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 727180105,
					"content": "還沒有。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						727180106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 727180106,
					"content": "那請在準備好了之後快點拿給我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "松本"
				}
